{"script":"yd_015_09-备份","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a","layer":"chara2","y":-474,"x":-120,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara015_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a","layer":"chara2","scaleY":1,"x":-120,"transTime":300,"y":-474,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara015_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]当孩子们被当代的杜尔们确认具有作为新一代首领的资质后，[r]他们就会被收养下来，追随先代学习必要的知识和技能。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]虽然如此，领导者的事务毕竟繁重，并没有那么多时间陪伴养子们。[r][l]多数时候，我们都是被聚集在养育所，集体接受老师的教导。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]在那里，我们一起生活、一起学习，然后发展为团结一心，宛如兄弟姐妹一般的亲密关系。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]虽然……到了最后，可能也只会有少数人能成为真正的杜尔，但我们之间的关系不会改变。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"芭杜尔-弟弟妹妹们"}